# FieldBourne Digital marketing site

Read `BRANDING.md` before any copy changes, then `AGENTS.md` and `README.md`.

## What this repo is

Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind marketing site. Deployed via GitHub Pages from `dist/`. Product app lives in [tv-magic-companion](https://github.com/missbeardy/tv-magic-companion) — link only, do not embed app code here.

## Key files

- `src/config/site.ts` — `formEndpoint`, `tvmagicAppUrl`, `contactEmail`, `siteUrl`
- `src/index.css` — brand tokens in `@theme` (exact FieldBourne hex values)
- `src/pages/` — Home, About, Fieldbourne case study, legal
- `src/components/motion.tsx` — FadeIn / Stagger with reduced-motion support
- `legacy/` — previous static HTML site (reference only)

## When editing

- Keep brand colours exact: teal `#1B6B6B`, amber `#E8943A`, cream `#F7F5F2`, charcoal `#1E2A2A`.
- Use `site.ts` for external URLs; avoid hard-coding contact email or app URLs.
- Follow `BRANDING.md` for voice, banned words, and the Section 8 self-check.
- Never use em dashes in site copy. Use commas, full stops, or colons instead.
- Australian English, trade-business tone, no generic SaaS jargon.
- Prefer intentional Motion moments over decorative noise; always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
